{"c":[{"id":"ed5a4442c6ce5e9c","sum":"Doctor rule (operator, 2026-10-21): discoverable doctor commands (probe, smoke) never write; writes only via 'stockroom doctor fix <name>'. DuckDB 2.0.0 vss HNSW replay bug: auto-checkpoint folds the wal, index misses replayed rows; moot once index and vss were dropped.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261021T174235Z-774be06df86dea8f","text":"stockroom doctor rule (operator, 2026-10-21): any discoverable doctor command (probe, smoke) never writes. Every doctor write sits behind 'stockroom doctor fix <name>' and runs only when named. First fix planned: 'doctor fix hnsw-wal' for the DuckDB 2.0.0 HNSW replay bug.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261021T175900Z-bd6ed7dba4d68c72","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0 replay bug goes silent: other writers succeed, the wal grows, and past checkpoint_threshold (16 MiB) the auto-checkpoint folds it. Then the HNSW index silently lacks the replayed rows (pragma_hnsw_index_info count < count(*)); top-k skips them. A rebuild fixes it.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"3315768ae2a907e4","sum":"Operator 2026-10-21: about five installs, nightly embed, rollout takes days; tune for a finished embed. A power loss may need the troubleshooting page and must not empty the warehouse. The HNSW doctor-only fold check and 'doctor fix hnsw-rebuild' went with the dropped index.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261021T191821Z-1972e75cf1dd3323","text":"Operator 2026-10-21: silent HNSW fold is doctor-only, plus an index-coverage check. No repair on reconnect. The fix command is doctor fix hnsw-rebuild.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261021T193821Z-1b68223f17357c6b","text":"Operator 2026-10-21: about five installs, nightly embed, rollout is days. Tune for a finished embed. A power loss may need the troubleshooting page. It must not empty the warehouse. HNSW drops only around inserts.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
